:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-500 to-secondary-500 text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity duration-200 px-6 py-2 font-semibold shadow-md hover:shadow-lg\">مشاوره رایگان</button></div><button class=\"lg:hidden p-2 rounded-md hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors duration-200\" aria-label=\"منوی موبایل\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6 text-text-700\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-blue-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center animate-fade-in\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 mb-4\">بهینه‌سازی جامع تکنیکال و داخلی</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">سئو <span class=\"gradient-text\">تکنیکال و داخلی</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">زیربنای فنی قدرتمند و محتوای بهینه‌سازی شده؛ دو بال پرواز وب‌سایت شما به صفحه اول گوگل. سرعت بالا، ساختار استاندارد و کلمات کلیدی هدفمند.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md px-8 gradient-bg text-white\">شروع بهینه‌سازی سایت</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-11 rounded-md px-8\">آنالیز رایگان فنی</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground shadow-sm text-center border-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-8 w-8 text-cyan-600 mx-auto mb-3\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-700 mb-2\">۳۰۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium\">افزایش سرعت سایت</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground shadow-sm text-center border-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-8 w-8 text-cyan-600 mx-auto mb-3\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-700 mb-2\">۹۵+</div><p class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium\">امتیاز PageSpeed</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground shadow-sm text-center border-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-8 w-8 text-cyan-600 mx-auto mb-3\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-700 mb-2\">۴۰۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium\">رشد ترافیک ارگانیک</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground shadow-sm text-center border-0 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"p-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-8 w-8 text-cyan-600 mx-auto mb-3\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-700 mb-2\">۱۰۰%</div><p class=\"text-gray-900 font-medium\">رفع خطاهای فنی</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">خدمات <span class=\"gradient-text\">سئو تکنیکال</span> (Technical SEO)</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">ساخت زیربنای فنی مستحکم برای درک بهتر سایت توسط گوگل</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">بهینه‌سازی سرعت و Core Web Vitals</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">افزایش سرعت لود صفحات به زیر ۳ ثانیه و بهبود امتیازهای حیاتی گوگل (LCP, FID, CLS).</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تجربه کاربری عالی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رتبه بهتر موبایل</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کاهش نرخ پرش</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">امنیت و SSL</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پیکربندی کامل HTTPS، رفع آسیب‌پذیری‌های امنیتی و حفاظت از داده‌های کاربران.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اعتماد کاربران</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>سیگنال مثبت رتبه‌بندی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>حفاظت از برند</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><polyline points=\"16 18 22 12 16 6\"></polyline><polyline points=\"8 6 2 12 8 18\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">داده‌های ساختاریافته (Schema)</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پیاده‌سازی کدهای اسکیما برای نمایش غنی در نتایج جستجو (ستاره، قیمت، سوالات متداول).</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نرخ کلیک بالاتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نمایش متمایز</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>درک بهتر گوگل</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">سئو موبایل (Mobile-First)</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">تضمین عملکرد بی‌نقص سایت در دستگاه‌های موبایل و تبلت با طراحی واکنش‌گرا.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ایندکس موبایل اول</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>دسترسی بیشتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رضایت کاربران</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">بهینه‌سازی خزش و ایندکس</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">مدیریت بودجه خزش، اصلاح فایل robots.txt و نقشه سایت برای ایندکس سریع و کامل.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ایندکس سریع‌تر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کشف صفحات جدید</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>حذف صفحات زاید</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-cyan-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-6 w-6 text-cyan-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">ساختار URL و معماری سایت</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">طراحی ساختار آدرس‌دهی منطقی و معماری اطلاعاتی برای درک آسان توسط کاربر و گوگل.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ناوبری آسان</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>توزیع اعتبار صفحات</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap